From 0b37f1272d531722f035c109442e441d6f39d9e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 02:12:41 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] One 3D mode: Enable 3D, quad-buffered stereo in the
 window's declared 3D area, no dialog

The stereo dialog (anaglyph, NVIDIA Vision, generic stereo display, side by side and the physical parameters: screen width,
distance, eye separation, strength) is not built, the glass type is neither stored nor read, and neither the exclusive full
screen mode nor a forced field of view is part of Enable 3D.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
